# Mesh Hop 0.1.2: the radio preset list (refreshed in the background, saved copy, built-in list), seen in the Preset popup.
# The download starts 4 s after the launch, so the first look is at 9 s. (the Preset row is the sixth selectable row of Settings, 0.7.0:
# after Name, Public key, Position, Board GPS and Node name, reached by keys; Settings is the page before Chats: Shift+Tab.)
wait 9000
key enter
wait 300
say == the list in use (see presets=origin/entries/date)
dump
key backtab
wait 300
key down
key down
key down
key down
key down
key enter
wait 500
say == the Preset popup, the footer says where the list comes from
dump
shot p1-preset-popup
key esc
wait 300
key tab
wait 300
shot p2-chats-footer
key enter
wait 300
shot p3-chats-footer-compose
key esc
